Phase 2A is complete.

We now have a validated, leak-free historical dataset containing 110,268 player-gameweek snapshots across:

- 2022/23
- 2023/24
- 2024/25
- 2025/26

with the chronological split:

TRAIN:
2022/23 + 2023/24

VALIDATION:
2024/25

TEST:
2025/26

The deterministic/statistical baseline is also complete through Phase 1C.

We are now beginning the FIRST ACTUAL MACHINE LEARNING MODEL.

IMPORTANT:

This phase is ONLY about the Expected Minutes / availability prediction problem.

Do NOT train xG.
Do NOT train xA.
Do NOT train Clean Sheet.
Do NOT train DEFCON.
Do NOT train Bonus.
Do NOT modify the optimizer.
Do NOT replace the current projection engine yet.
Do NOT change the current team-strength model.
