==================================================

Before training, produce a feature audit.

For every feature intended for the model, document:

- Feature name
- Meaning
- Data type
- Source
- Whether it is numeric/categorical
- Missing-value behaviour
- Temporal origin
- Why it could have been known before the GW deadline

Pay particular attention to:

