vs
LOGISTIC / SIMPLE BASELINE
vs
LIGHTGBM / XGBOOST

Use the VALIDATION season (2024/25) for model selection.

Only after selecting the model should the untouched 2025/26 TEST season be evaluated.

Report both:

Validation performance
Test performance

The test set must be evaluated ONCE after model selection.

